==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|frm|saulver}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|sauver}}, from Gallo-Romance {{m|fro|salvar}}, from {{der|fr|LL.|salvāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|salvō||I save}}, from {{der|fr|la|salvus}}.
* Compare {{cog|it|salvare}}, {{cog|es|salvar}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|Fr-sauver.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# to [[save]], [[rescue]]; to [[protect]]
# {{lb|fr|computing}} to save
# {{lb|fr|pronominal}} to [[escape]], [[run away]]
# {{lb|fr|Louisiana French|Cajun French}} to [[economize]]

====Conjugation====
{{fr-conj-auto}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|computing}} {{l|fr|sauvegarder}}

